				Time="2011-07-11T12:29:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　静かに　飛び去り
姿を　消した……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-11T12:29:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
